graph TD
    A([Başlangıç]) --> B[FluidError: hata tipi]
    B --> C[DataStall: veri akışı durdu]
    B --> D[DivergenceExplosion: PDE ıraksadı NaN/Inf]
    B --> E[DbError: SQLite erişim hatası]
    B --> F[RingBufferDisconnect: shm erişim hatası]
    B --> G[InvalidGridDimension: geçersiz grid]
    B --> H[SymbolNotFound: sembol bulunamadı]

    A --> I[InflowData: piyasa giriş verisi — price, volume, oi_delta, funding_rate, buy_sell_ratio, liquidation_volume, timestamp_ms]
    I --> J[PhaseSpace: NX çarpı NY grid kurulumu]
    J --> K[NSSolver: Navier-Stokes adım pipeline]
    K --> L[SolverState: mean_density, max_velocity, mean_pressure, viscous, divergence_norm, is_stable, steps_completed]
    L --> M[TrbReport: ana rapor çıktısı — tüm katmanları birleştirir]
    M --> N[BurstSignal: kavitasyon sinyali — trigger_price, frequency, amplitude, direction]
    M --> O[CalibrationResult: viscosity, smagorinsky_cs, cost, iterations]
    M --> P[OrderSlice: TWAP emir dilimi — size, price_offset, index]
    M --> Q[NarrativeOutput: phase_label, flow_direction, turbulence_level, summary, risk_warning]
    M --> R[AuditMeta: analysis_time, grid_nx, grid_ny, data_source, calibration_version]
    R --> Z([Bitiş])
